{"version":1,"content":"<p>【好東西 ✅】 GitHub 近日出現一款名為「Disc Image Studio」的多平台光碟表面圖像生成與燒錄工具，徹底打破以往必須依賴特殊光雕機（如 LightScribe 或 Labelflash）與專用碟片的限制。</p><p>該工具允許用家利用市面上任何標準光碟燒錄機，在常見的普通 CD、DVD 及單層藍光（BD-R 25 GB）光碟表面直接燒錄出肉眼清晰可見的圖案。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T18:00:42.583915+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T17:47:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:35:14.603239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T17:58:22.546976+00:00","content_hash":"23833fc7a5b45e9336d5d01fe5d529ff0740658c4c4d7fe1039139044ac21cbe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}